      "textData": {
       "text": "Then came the art. Every crew member got an HD summon banner, and Nero set the rule for them: cosy, candid moments at home on the ship, warm and kind, never menacing. The level-up screens got full-screen art of the crew out adventuring on planets. Crew cards got pixel portraits, the newest crew fight as pixel chibis, and gear and currencies got real painted icons.",
